NEIL W. McCABE: Roy Cooper accelerated the release of 3,500 inmates using COVID as the excuse. He released 83 murderers, 51 of them serving life sentences, and 25 of them went on to commit further murders after their COVID release.

How is this guy even still in politics?

@ReporterMcCabe

NATALIE WINTERS: A CCP run university is advertising J-1 visas for students to take summer jobs at McDonald’s, Hilton and Universal Studios. The qualifier is they must be willing to promote pro-China propaganda in line with Xi Jinping Thought.

That’s infiltration if I’ve ever seen it.

@nataliegwinters

JOHN SOLOMON: The most important document released today is a previously classified email from George Kent to Marie Yovanovitch saying Joe Biden should be told his son undercut U.S. anti-corruption efforts in Ukraine.

It directly contradicts what the impeachment team told America.

